  "raw_block": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Rec Swim Hours</h3>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rec swim hours are subject to change; check the website regularly before coming in*.</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lanes are available on a first-come, first-served basis during the following times for recreational lap swimming only.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*<strong><em>Updated 8/31/26</em></strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Comp Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 8/31: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 9/1: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 9/2: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 9/3: Closed</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 9/4: 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 9/5: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 9/6: Closed</p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Dive Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 8/31: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 9/1: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 9/2: 6am-8am, 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 9/3: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 9/4: 6am-8am &amp; 11am-1pm </p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 9/5: 11am-12pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 9/6: Closed</p>"
